# Deliberately NARROW. This repo does not blanket-ignore build output, because some JLib repos
# intentionally commit their x64/ folders so a clone can build without a separate deploy step.
# Only the bench's local artifacts are ignored here: bench.exe is a few hundred KB of binary that
# would bloat history for no benefit, and it is rebuilt by bench/build_bench.bat in seconds.
bench/*.exe
bench/*.obj
bench/*.pdb
bench/*.ilk
